-- a user whose own settings make the guard writable
restore writable guard rejected
nothing restored: 0
-- a user whose own setting is above the creator's bound
restore above bound rejected
nothing restored: 0
-- a user whose own setting fits the creator's bound
restore within bound: ok, exists 1
-- a profile with one parent outside the default profile's tree
restore mixed rejected
nothing restored: 0 0
-- a profile in the backup replaced by an existing profile of the same name, which the restore keeps
restore with the existing profile: ok, exists 1
the kept profile inherits:	default
